{"id":"ledi","lemma":"леди","pos":"noun","rank":405,"glosses":["lady (usually in British context; title of a woman of breeding and authority)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/06/Ru-%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%B8.ogg/Ru-%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%B8.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","examples":[{"text":"Интересно, кто была эта леди.","en":"I wonder who that lady was.","words":[{"g":"it is interesting"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,null]},{"text":"Он согласился помочь старой леди.","en":"He consented to help the old lady.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to agree","l":"согласиться"},{"g":"to help"},null,null]},{"text":"Пожалуйста, вызовите такси для этой леди.","en":"Please call a taxi for this lady.","words":[{"g":"please"},{"g":"to call, to send for","l":"вызвать"},{"g":"taxi"},{"g":"for"},null,null]},{"text":"Кто эти юные леди?","en":"Who are these young ladies?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"this/that one","l":"этот"},{"g":"young, youthful","l":"юный"},null]},{"text":"Она была бывшей первой леди.","en":"She was a former first lady.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"ex","l":"бывшая"},null,null]}]}